00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.501
Tennessee became the

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.536
first state in the country to restrict

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.438
drag show performances.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:06.573
