00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.212
to shield children

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:14.014
from seeing the performances.

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.181
Violators could be charged

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:16.216
with a misdemeanor

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:17.984
and repeat offenders a felony

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:19.352
in addition to the drag law.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:20.653
The governor banned gender

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.455
affirming medical care for minors,

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:24.758
even if the child's parent approves.

